{"_type":"shard","campaign_names":["Roanoke S3","Roanoke Season 3","roanoke-s3"],"channel":{"category":"🏘 Roanoke Town.","id":"741771055840100422","name":"town-hall","position":48,"server_id":"636012145204527125","topic":null,"type":"0"},"database_path":"discord/roanoke-season-3/roanoke-season-3.sqlite","database_sha256":"16d47fa7c4f38d18670fc7fc2639614b0b61c31f716d8e6ecba86f1f87412b4d","project_ids":["roanoke-s3"],"server":{"harvested_at":"2026-10-01T23:13:18Z","id":"636012145204527125","name":"Roanoke Season 3"},"server_slug":"roanoke-season-3"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"741771055840100422","content":"Web spreads out the various letters and other notes. They take a deep breath and begin.\n“Would like to start with an apology. Mostly to Sandigill, though he no longer in town. Many of us too focused on own individual problems and goals, could not focus on bigger picture. Could not focus on town. I no exception. Worried too much about petty issues. Should have had this meeting days ago. Maybe could have stopped war even earlier. I am sorry.” Web pauses, looking out at all those assembled, then continues.\n“The Urucockra and Chinookin are assembling. For war. Have been corresponding with Halfwudgie elder for a few days. Started out with asking about Halfwudgie burial rites for one killed by dire bear. Became more useful, talking about relations. Learned today from him exactly how to stop flooding. Uru have begun killing bird messengers so will not get more information now. In temple, there is lodestone. Similar as ones had to remove to free Bahamut and stop grease. He believes will end flooding, and that will stop war. Web agree. Believe that if temple fixed Chinookin be able to breed and Uru not be flooded. Hopefully will prevent war.”\nWeb pauses again.","created_at":"2020-08-12T20:46:05.489000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743208713669574688","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"741771055840100422","content":"“Chinookin lead by Fishmother and Urucockra lead by oligarchy, most powerful is Longclaw. If they meet in battle, consequences disastrous. Web believe from history and talk from other Chinookin that these leaders not always leaders, or not always like are now: cruel, vain. Web worry that hunger involved to make them like this. Hope simply mortal desires and could be united against hunger. If not, may have to unite those under rule without help from leaders. But know that Longclaw respect might and Fishmother respect supplication. Will be tricky.”\n“Sandigill has left to be with Chinookin. Believe he determined if war could not be stopped, would rather be with his people.”\nWeb takes another breath. \n“Propose that we send groups to both forces separately, in order to secure safer passage to temple. Can offer Urucockra end to flooding and Chinookin return of breeding grounds. Can mention to both previous experience removing lodestones. Then enter temple and remove lodestone, hopefully stopping war. Should succeed, may be able to bring Fishmother and Longclaw to peace table, discuss hunger.”\nWeb sighs. “Thoughts?”","created_at":"2020-08-12T20:46:12.370000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743208742530711644","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
